    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-f7fcc9e15b5465e9e48b0b1ec887862a519366a0",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "# Reservoir station\n\nThese procedures apply to the unmanned reservoir station during winter operation.\n\n",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 4
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-4c636deed7795587d70924f4456f5808b1e04942",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "## Restart\n\nRestart the circulation pump only after the inlet sensor reads at least four degrees Celsius. Record the sensor reading in the shift ledger before pressing START.\n\n",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-29c20813a67a3f3caebf200991ec0389ac1eb52f",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "### Inspection\n\nBefore restart, inspect the intake grille and remove accumulated leaves. A cracked grille requires replacement before the pump may run.\n\n",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-76a8e28088444f3af9da50ef58ee19e3d77122a4",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "### Indicator lamps\n\nThe amber cabinet lamp indicates that the maintenance drawer is open. Closing the drawer extinguishes this lamp; the lamp does not measure inlet temperature.\n\n",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-440b67b131f2063188b2b7dec08f5630764fdd07",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "## Frozen intake\n\nWhen ice remains visible inside the intake, restarting the circulation pump is prohibited even if the inlet sensor reads four degrees Celsius or more. Request a manual thaw inspection instead.\n\n",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-f405fd19b852b1814527e06693d4b59bee3a567c",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "## Ledger storage\n\nCompleted shift ledgers are archived in the west cabinet for nine months. The cabinet key is held by the records clerk.\n\n",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 24
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-16dd27e1375dd6976478c95c5a6f4214402c34e3",
      "source_path": "reservoir.md",
      "display_text": "## Cabinet finish\n\nThe exterior cabinet is painted slate blue. Replacement paint tins are stored with the building supplies.\n",
      "line_start": 25,
      "line_end": 27
    }
  ],
